    "Behaviour",
    "Simplify information, never options. At rest a panel drops facts that repeat or say nothing now: scope lines, second lines, labels, marks and colour with no reason. Those facts come back under the pointer or keyboard. Every action and option, those the app has and those we added, stays visible and one press away. Colour stays only on what asks for you, and failures stay loud."
